From: dnf-for-termux <dev@termux.dev>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Add missing <sstream>/<fstream> includes

libc++ from NDK r29 no longer drags <sstream>/<fstream> in
transitively. Add the direct include to every file that uses
std::ostringstream/std::istringstream/std::stringstream or
std::ifstream/std::ofstream without including the header.

diff --git a/dnf5/commands/versionlock/utils.cpp b/dnf5/commands/versionlock/utils.cpp
--- a/dnf5/commands/versionlock/utils.cpp
+++ b/dnf5/commands/versionlock/utils.cpp
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@
 
 #include <chrono>
 #include <iomanip>
+#include <sstream>
 
 std::string format_comment(std::string_view cmd) {
     // format the comment for new config file entries
